{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤詩織です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKASEETWWXB8Q1FZPRQ5X8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はふーちゃんの誕生日でした🎂✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふーちゃんは私が辛いとき\n必ず連絡くれたり話しかけてくれたり\n本当に かけがえのない存在!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして大好きで大好きで\nずっと一緒に上を目指してる存在"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただの友達でも仲間でも家族でもない\n特別な特別な存在です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなふーちゃんの記念すべき\nハタチの誕生日に一日中一緒に\nいれるとか、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうわたし彼氏やん!有難う最高ッ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じで♡👩‍❤️‍💋‍👩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々のデートはとても素晴らしく\n幸せな時間だったし\n(あ、いやだけど二人共すぐ胃もたれして\nちょいと年を感じました。笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高でした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、SHOWROOMに\n観に来てくれたみんなありがとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKATCMKZPE7GAY7ZCGDGVG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4万人を超えた方々に来てもらい\n最高に幸せでした☺️✨"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふーちゃんの誕生日、\n一緒に祝えて良かった〜〜!!\nみんな本当にありがとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、ゲスト電話出演の\nなーこ りか(尾関)ありがとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人のおかげで後半カオスで\n面白かった!笑 カオス大好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふーちゃんは安定に面白いので\nツボに入ってしまって大変だった。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなふーちゃんとできて\n幸せハッピーだった!✨✨😭\nまたやろう〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて!本日14時まで握手会二次応募\n受付中です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだあるよ〜〜来てね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYKAVAC6TENATK8T3F7JZRQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"https://fortunemusic.jp/keyakizaka46_201803/\n↑ここからできるよ!会いに来てね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、またね!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤詩織"}],"source":"archive"}